#: src/examples.md:1
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: src/examples.md:3
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: src/examples.md:3
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: src/examples.md:5
msgid "`rustup default nightly`"
msgstr "`rusup 默认夜晚`"

#: src/examples.md:5
msgid ""
"Set the [default toolchain](overrides.md#default-toolchain) to the latest "
"nightly"
msgstr "将[默认工具链](overrides.md#default-toolchain) 设置为最新夜晚。"

#: src/examples.md:6
msgid "`rustup set profile minimal`"
msgstr "`rusup 设置简档最小化`"

#: src/examples.md:6
msgid "Set the default [profile](concepts/profiles.md)"
msgstr ""
"设置默认 [profile](concepts/profiles.md)设置默认[配置文件](concepts/profiles."
"md)"

#: src/examples.md:7
msgid "`rustup target list`"
msgstr "`rustup target list`"

#: src/examples.md:7
msgid ""
"List all available [targets](cross-compilation.md) for the active toolchain"
msgstr "列出所有活动工具链的 [targets](cross-compilation.md)"

#: src/examples.md:8
msgid "`rustup target add arm-linux-androideabi`"
msgstr "`rustup target add arm-linux-androideabi`"

#: src/examples.md:8
msgid "Install the Android target"
msgstr "Install the Android target安装安卓目标设备"

#: src/examples.md:9
msgid "`rustup target remove arm-linux-androideabi`"
msgstr "`rusup targets remove arm-linux-androideabi`  "

#: src/examples.md:9
msgid "Remove the Android target"
msgstr "移除安卓目标"

#: src/examples.md:10
msgid "`rustup run nightly rustc foo.rs`"
msgstr "`rusup 每晚运行rustc foo.rs`"

#: src/examples.md:10
msgid "Run the nightly regardless of the active toolchain"
msgstr "不论活动的工具链，每晚运行一次"

#: src/examples.md:11
msgid "`rustc +nightly foo.rs`"
msgstr "`rustc +夜间foo.rs`  "

#: src/examples.md:11
msgid ""
"[Shorthand](overrides.md#toolchain-override-shorthand) way to run a nightly "
"compiler"
msgstr ""
"[Shorthand](overrides.md#toolchain-override-shorthand) 每晚运行一个编译器的方"
"法"

#: src/examples.md:12
msgid "`rustup run nightly bash`"
msgstr "`rusup 夜间运行 bash`"

#: src/examples.md:12
msgid "Run a shell configured for the nightly compiler"
msgstr "运行一个为夜间编译器配置的shell文件"

#: src/examples.md:13
msgid "`rustup default stable-msvc`"
msgstr "`rusup default stable-msvc`  "

#: src/examples.md:13
msgid "On Windows, use the MSVC toolchain instead of GNU"
msgstr "在 Windows上，使用 MSVC 工具链而不是 GNU"

#: src/examples.md:14
msgid "`rustup override set nightly-2015-04-01`"
msgstr "`rusup overlapper 设置 2015-04-01`  "

#: src/examples.md:14
msgid "For the current directory, use a nightly from a specific date"
msgstr "对于当前目录，从指定日期起使用每夜一次"

#: src/examples.md:15
msgid "`rustup toolchain link my-toolchain \"C:\\RustInstallation\"`"
msgstr "`rusup toolchain link my-toolchain \"C:\\RustInstallation\"`  "

#: src/examples.md:15
msgid "Install a custom toolchain by symlinking an existing installation"
msgstr "通过创建符号链接来安装自定义的工具链，从而替代现有的安装程序。"

#: src/examples.md:16
msgid "`rustup show`"
msgstr "`rusup show`  "

#: src/examples.md:16
msgid "Show which toolchain will be used in the current directory"
msgstr "请显示当前目录下将使用的工具链。"

#: src/examples.md:17
msgid "`rustup toolchain uninstall nightly`"
msgstr "`rustup 工具链 卸载 夜间版`"

#: src/examples.md:17
msgid "Uninstall a given toolchain"
msgstr "卸载指定的工具链"

#: src/examples.md:18
msgid "`rustup toolchain help`"
msgstr "`rustup 工具链帮助`"

#: src/examples.md:18
msgid "Show the `help` page for a subcommand (like `toolchain`)"
msgstr "显示有关子命令（如`toolchain`）的帮助页面。"

#: src/examples.md:19
msgid "`rustup man cargo`"
msgstr "`rusup man cargo`  "

#: src/examples.md:19
msgid "(_Unix only_) View the man page for a given command (like `cargo`)"
msgstr "(仅适用于 Unix 系统）查看特定命令的说明页，例如`cargo`命令。"
